# Small fixtures stay as regular blobs to save LFS bandwidth (path-specific
# entries win over the extension patterns above). Every committed raw-blob
# fixture must be listed here: otherwise a fresh clone with git-lfs
# installed shows a dirty tree (F-11) and `git commit -a` would silently
# rewrite the blob into an LFS pointer. If a fixture genuinely needs LFS
# (large file), remove its exemption AND migrate it with `git lfs migrate`,
# never just delete the line.
